{
  "id": "research-records",
  "title": {
    "zh": "研究记录",
    "en": "Research notes"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "记下一次推导、仿真或实验：研究问题、目的、假设、步骤、环境、随机种子、参数与指标（带单位）、结论、依据与适用边界，并引用记录、条目或材料作为证据。同一套方案下的运行会列在详情里，也能一键新建一条计划中的运行去运行记录卡继续填写。列表按做法筛选，也能搜索、归档与移入回收站；详情直接编辑并在输入时自动存草稿，保存失败保留输入，修订冲突可以载入最新记录。缺失的内容显示「未知」，这里只记录不执行实验程序。",
    "en": "Records a derivation, simulation or experiment: research question, purpose, hypothesis, steps, environment, seeds, parameters and metrics with units, conclusion with basis and scope, and evidence cited from records, entries or materials. Runs that use this note as their plan are listed in the detail, and New run creates a planned run to continue on the run records card. The list filters by method, also searches, archives and trashes; the detail edits in place, keeps a draft while you type, keeps your input when saving fails, and offers the latest record on a revision conflict. Missing content shows as unknown, and nothing is executed here."
  },
  "author": "dsh-scholar-board",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "sizes": [
    "m",
    "l"
  ],
  "source": "widget-board:records",
  "capabilities": [
    "widget-board:records.read",
    "widget-board:records.write",
    "widget-board:records.draft",
    "widget-board:records.open"
  ],
  "defaultBox": {
    "w": 2,
    "h": 28
  },
  "minBox": {
    "w": 1,
    "h": 16
  },
  "scripts": [
    "research-model.js",
    "copy.js",
    "view.js",
    "evidence-editor.js",
    "editor.js"
  ],
  "props": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 80
      },
      "kicker": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 40
      }
    }
  },
  "data": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
